        "cooked": "<p>I am some what confused with Infinitor flip effec. The effec where you flip him if there are more h or mesnifestation. Also if you top deck insanity with insanity does it still keep on going and with insanity can it make you play many manifestations? Thanks.&nbsp;</p>",
