      {
        "id": 129140,
        "name": "Koga",
        "username": "Koga",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-24T07:07:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Mr.JJ\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mr.jj/48/5371_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Mr.JJ:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If he got all of his manifestations out, wouldn't he start an endless cycle of card plays?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>A card that plays a card stays in play until the card it plays resolves, so they will stack until the final play resolves, then the stack would go into the trash. This is to help&nbsp;prevent infinite loops.</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:04:01.704Z",
