        "created_at": "2015-01-24T19:24:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Potentially, yes, he could play all of his one-shots, but once he got them all into play he would just stop. Although, once you got to that point, you would be screwed anyway. Those manifestations are NASTY.</p>",
