        "created_at": "2015-01-27T04:01:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>To Clarify:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If Insanity plays Insanity, the first insanity will not act anymore, it put a card into play, that card was not a manifestation, Insanity will not repeat.</p><p>If the Second Insanity plays a manifestation, its text will repeat, but the first Insanity's text will not.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So if a chain of Manifestations played by Insanity leads to a second Insanity, you will continue to play the top card, but it will have nothing to do with the original Insanity, because it will not act again, but simply wait to go to the trash.</p>",
